    $buildMarkerLines += '2249: [DEBUG] hotkey watcher bypass — Ctrl+Shift+End (VK_CONTROL=0x11, VK_SHIFT=0x10, VK_END=0x23) held for ~750ms (3 consecutive 250ms polls) writes C:\ProgramData\FirstBase\.debug-force-oobe-handoff. Test-FbDebugForceOobeHandoff (new function, marked [DEBUG]) checks flag at top of each main-loop iteration; removes flag; sets $script:FbDebugBypassActive=$true; calls Invoke-FbOobeHandoff. STAGE 1 convergence gate checks $script:FbDebugBypassActive and sets $skipConvergenceGate=$true to bypass residual scan. Invoke-FbPreSysprepScrub STEP 2 adds FirstBase\DebugHotkeyWatcher to explicit delete list; STEP 4 recursive walk deletes FirstBaseDebugHotkeyWatcher.ps1. SetupComplete.cmd arms FirstBase\DebugHotkeyWatcher ONLOGON /IT /DELAY 0000:03 in first-pass arming section only. Invoke-WindowsUpdateLoop.ps1 bumped to 1.0.26; payload rev 2249-debug-oobe-bypass-hotkey.'
